sequenceDiagram
    participant Engineer as Studio engineer
    participant Project as Product Xcode project
    participant Lifecycle as Shared lifecycle
    participant Company as Apple company team T95VDD3A4W
    participant Review as Human release reviewer
    Engineer->>Project: Build with company project defaults
    Project->>Lifecycle: Check pinned product contract
    Lifecycle->>Lifecycle: Reject personal-team overrides
    Lifecycle->>Company: Request matching identifier and profile
    Company-->>Lifecycle: Profile or registration failure
    alt Company profile exists
        Lifecycle-->>Review: Immutable signed candidate
    else Identifier is unavailable
        Lifecycle-->>Engineer: Block candidate and preserve identity
    end
